138 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E ( This project focuses on the design and implementation of a robust relational database management system for an Online Course Learning Progress Management System. Because unstructured data makes progress tracking unreliable, this system provides a centralized way to accurately manage content hierarchy, student enrolments, lesson progress, quiz attempts, final scores, and certificates. By translating a comprehensive Entity-Relationship model into a relational schema normalized up to Third Normal Form \(3NF\), the database guarantees data integrity and eliminates redundancy. Ultimately, this foundational structure will be implemented using MySQL, PostgreSQL, or Oracle and connected to a custom Java or Python front-end application to seamlessly support the entire e-learning lifecycle, from initial course publishing to automated certificate issuance )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
